    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="ad52100a-c685-5e88-88c4-328c782bd55e" activityNameId="8737c99c-3a7a-5b3a-9d33-ebe3f05f0fa0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="2" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Aluminium profile, uncoated, Hydro Building Systems, Circal, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminium profile, uncoated, Hydro Building Systems, Circal, at regional storage
Transport distances determined by the production-weighted average distances of the plants in Nenzing and Bellenberg to Berne.;
UUID: 4b4cdbb7-1edb-3e1c-a7c0-53a5bb19d516
Included are the production of aluminium profiles with a recycling share of 82.1% in Nenzing and Bellenberg as well as the transport from the production sites to Switzerland.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland. Production occurs at SAPA Building Systems AG in Nenzing (AT) and Bellenberg (DE).
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at SAPA Building Systems AG. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4b4cdbb7-1edb-3e1c-a7c0-53a5bb19d516.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
